      {
        "id": 200968,
        "name": "carnilius",
        "username": "carnilius",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-07T18:04:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>To add to justification for the Fear Victory, think of it this way:</p><ol>\n<li>Terror Level 1: &nbsp;Invaders are not afraid</li>\n<li>Terror Level 2: &nbsp;Invaders are afraid on their own, but feel safe in towns and cities</li>\n<li>Terror Level 3: &nbsp;Invaders feel that small towns no longer offer protection and they only feel safe in cities</li>\n<li>Victory: &nbsp;Invaders no longer feel safe anywhere, even in cities, and flee the island abandoning their cities.</li>\n</ol>",
        "post_number": 27,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:29:22.839Z",
