        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-09T11:48:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Phantaskippy, can I suggest that you edit your guide to make it clear that you can flip <span class=\"bbcode-b\">any</span> fear card? This is a common mistake, and makes Bringer of Dreams &amp; Nightmares significantly stronger if you play it right. For instance, it's not really that crucial to flip a Fear card every single turn, as long as you're strategic about which card to flip.</p>\n<p>This is (now) <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4g8rd\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">a FAQ</a>, but I think it won't occur to many people to look it up.</p>",
